<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz GDP rises 3.1 pct in Jan-Aug.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz GDP rises 3.1 pct in Jan-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product in the first eight months of this year totalled 12.01 billion som, which was 3.1 percent more than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-Aug 96  Jan-Jul 96  Jan-Aug 95</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	+3.1	  +1.5	  -9.8</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
